text The ceremony is being held in a plain classroom without any decorations.
text It's a modest wedding consisting of only the groom, the bride, and several teachers who know the bride.
text But what matters most is the fact that the two are exchanging an eternal oath right at this place where Kouko-san used to teach.
text She's so beautiful.
